# Database dumps. These contain real user data — emails, password hashes,
# activation codes. gate-restore-check.sh writes one into the repo root, and an
# untracked file one `git add -A` away from a public remote is not a risk worth
# carrying.
prod-dump-*.sql.gz
*.sql.gz
